# Rise from the Wreck's "up to one target creature card with no abilities": Ninja Teen at level 3 says "Creature cards in your
# graveyard have sneak {3}{B}", so a Grizzly Bears in the graveyard has sneak, an ability (CR 113.1, 113.6, 702.190a) - in the
# main phase too, where sneak can't be used: a card has an ability whether or not it may be used now. Turn 1: Ninja Teen off
# three Moxen. Turn 3: Black Lotus pays for levels 2 and 3, Grizzly Bears is cast and Lightning Bolted. Turn 5: Rise from the
# Wreck takes the Bears for "target creature card"; the no-abilities slot is not asked at all. The Bears returns.

